stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB

  [*] --> HELD: hold_slot (atomic SETNX, TTL 240s)
  HELD --> CONSUMED: confirm_action succeeds
  HELD --> RELEASED: call ends / caller declines
  HELD --> EXPIRED: TTL lapses (abandoned call)
  CONSUMED --> [*]
  RELEASED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]

  note right of HELD
    Lock key: {practice_id}:{clinician_id}:{slot_start_iso}
    Owner: call_session_id
    TTL: N seconds, renewable once, maximum M minutes total
    Store: Redis SET key value NX PX
    State: HELD -> CONSUMED / EXPIRED / RELEASED
  end note
